# Selecting text in a message shows a bar of actions just above it, inside the
# window, as T3 Code's and the desktop client's: add it to the chat, have it
# explained in a side chat, or ask about it in one. The bar goes once the
# selection does or the conversation scrolls; the right-click menu stays.
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press このプロジェクトで新しいチャット
type "AI に依頼する" "[selection] [immediate] 選択の操作を確かめます"
press 送信
expect "Needle Alpha Bravo." 30000
select "*Needle Alpha*" Alpha
expect_inside 詳細を表示 10000
expect_inside チャットに追加
expect_inside サイドチャットで質問
screenshot selection-bar
press チャットに追加
expect "> Alpha" after "AI に依頼する"
expect_absent 詳細を表示
# Leaving the text takes the bar away (selection-bar-scroll: scrolling too).
select "*Needle Alpha*" Alpha
expect 詳細を表示 10000
click none "AI に依頼する"
expect_absent 詳細を表示 10000
# Asking in a side chat quotes the selection there.
select "*Needle Alpha*" Bravo
press サイドチャットで質問
expect "> Bravo" after ツールを追加 10000
# The right-click menu still offers the selection's actions.
select "*Needle Alpha*" Alpha
menu "*Needle Alpha*"
press サイドチャットで質問
expect "> Alpha" after ツールを追加 10000
# Explaining sends the side chat's first message at once.
select "*Needle Alpha*" Alpha
press 詳細を表示
expect "次の選択範囲について詳しく説明してください。" after ツールを追加 30000
screenshot explained
